WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.650
Long words look scary until you take them apart.

00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:07.130
Peel off the beginning and the ending first.

00:00:07.130 --> 00:00:10.810
What’s left is usually a word you already know.

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:11.640
Unhappy:

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:14.490
take off un, and there’s happy.

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:18.100
Then the syllables almost split themselves.
